        <span class="msv__alert-icon">⚠️</span>
        <div>
          <p><strong>Check with your specific consulate:</strong> A small number of consulates may have different policies regarding public healthcare and NLV renewal. Before you rely on the convenio especial, contact your consulate directly and confirm their stance. Policy can vary by region and changes occasionally.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
